{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-03_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-03","title":"人工製冷","storyCode":"4-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ac276ff7db11c2ee0970f76b9c42002fd04b63a1d5f613da59974b798e7f09b7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，保持聯絡。嗅到氣味就立刻告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"按第三個鍵就行。嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭呢？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭前往貧民區了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——你居然讓她一個人去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......也罷，至少有人保護她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟著去了，有很大機率是個拖油瓶。這次就不怪罪你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是一個人回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要更加關注自己的人身安全。我們不是每次都能雇傭到可靠的本地嚮導的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭不會在龍門逗留太長時間，畢竟之後還有任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你還會再一次面對她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果是我的話，會把當時沒說出來的話，說出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一直在等我嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，讓你久等了"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我的表情與離開時不太一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許陳長官，她也有著自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使她嘴巴很凶，即使她做了我難以接受的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許......我們之間的隔閡也沒有那麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她有她的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她也承擔了很多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我也......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，你也承擔了許多事情。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......只是沒有其他的選擇而已。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少阿米婭你堅持了自己的選擇。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果導致那樣的結果，也算是堅持的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士沒必要......這樣安慰我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我們走到哪一天，這片大地才會變得不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我會承擔任何後果，因為......這是我自己選的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你會......陪在我身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管......這種愧疚，會一直存在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒能抓住大家的遺憾，沒能救助朋友的遺憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須坦然面對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"和羅德島的大家一起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是凱爾希醫生的通訊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生？請問有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，有幾支偵查小隊發來了消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"情況變得有些刻不容緩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我馬上就來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
